  "body": "Stacked on #1996 (merge #1996 first)\n\nProcess change: yes\n\n## What changed\n- Added shared `assert_stack_in`, `assert_window_layout`, and `assert_fixture_modal` helpers in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`, and simplified `layout_window_debug_info` to use `assert_window_layout`.\n- Added 8 named layout tests in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`:\n  - `layout_window_post_refusal` (Post refused floating window)\n  - `layout_window_unsaved_prompt` (Unsaved changes modal and its `Cancel` button)\n  - `layout_window_fixture_library` (Save fixture and Insert from library modals)\n  - `layout_window_fixture_vise` (Add built-in vise modal)\n  - `layout_window_fixture_plate` (Add fixture plate modal)\n  - `layout_window_fixture_accessory` (Add accessory modal)\n  - `layout_window_machines` (Machines dock pane leaf containment and anchors)\n  - `layout_window_gcode` (`G-code - program` floating window)\n- Recorded the design choices in `docs/decisions/1991-window-layout-tests.md`.\n\n## Cause\nPR `#1996` covered property pages and the Debug info window in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`. The remaining floating windows, fixture and unsaved modals, and Machines dock pane lacked named layout tests. All tested targets already lay out inside the screen and their containers without product-code changes.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins added: `layout_window_post_refusal`, `layout_window_unsaved_prompt`, `layout_window_fixture_library`, `layout_window_fixture_vise`, `layout_window_fixture_plate`, `layout_window_fixture_accessory`, `layout_window_machines`, `layout_window_gcode` (test-only addition; no product bug existed before the fix).\n- Review fix: modal frames must stay inside the screen. Anchors and the dismiss button must stay inside each modal.\n- Mutation results: off-screen frames, escaped anchors, and escaped Cancel buttons failed the modal tests. The old screen-only anchor check accepted escaped anchors. Restored checks passed all 9 named tests.\n- `cargo xtask gate test layout_window_`: 9 passed, 0 failed (`ui lib`).\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`ui lib` 870 passed, 6 ignored; `boundary` 3 passed; `boundary_picks` 6 passed; `sinker_setup` 2 passed; `tap_hand` 3 passed; `theme_files` 14 passed; `waterjet_tool` 1 passed; 0 failed).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (0 warnings).\n\n## Goldens moved\nnone\n\n## Not exercised\n- Other workspace crates outside the quick-gate UI plan (`geometry`, `kernel`, `cl`, `tools`, `post`, `sim`, `motion`, `app`).\n- The 6 `#[ignore]`d release-lane snapshot tests in `camcraft-ui --lib`.\n\n## Overlaps\n- Stacked on `#1996` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`, refactors `layout_window_debug_info` and appends tests beneath it). Merge `#1996` first.\n\nChangelog: none\nFixes #1991\n\n",
